# AB-012: Diluting a buffer preserves its ratio but weakens capacity per volume
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.001mol
add v1 NaOAc 0.001mol
new
decant v1 v2 0.5
dilute v1 50mL
dilute v2 450mL
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
add v1 HCl 0.00005mol
add v2 HCl 0.00025mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
